    <string name="ip_info_live_body">Live with IP makes the simulated location follow your IP address. Turn it on and GhostRoute goes to the place your IP points to (for example your VPN\'s exit country) and starts there. When your VPN reconnects or you switch servers, it checks again within a few seconds and moves to the new place. If your VPN drops and does not come back, it keeps the last location instead of following your real IP; turn Live with IP off and on again to follow your direct connection instead. It follows only while a simulation is running. A VPN that changes server without reconnecting is picked up by the periodic check instead. Choosing a place on the map or moving the joystick turns it off.</string>

